The upstream R package declares "License: CeCILL-2" and every computational
source file states that it must be used under the terms of the CeCILL license.
This translation preserves that licensing declaration and the original copyright
notices. The authoritative English license text is available from the CeCILL
project at:

  https://cecill.info/licences/Licence_CeCILL_V2-en.html

